<div class="bg-slate-950 text-white">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 text-center space-y-6">
    <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-blue-200">For Airbnb & VRBO Hosts</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold">Stop relying only on Airbnb & VRBO</h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-blue-100 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      Get found by Google and AI assistants like ChatGPT. Reach travelers researching neighborhoods instead of waiting for them to find you on booking platforms.
    </p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-left mt-10">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6">
        <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-2">200+</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-blue-100">Cities where travelers actively search for the best neighborhoods for their next stay</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6">
        <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-2">0%</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-blue-100">Commission (vs Airbnb's 15-20% and VRBO's 10-15%)</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6">
        <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-2">$120</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-blue-100">One-time cost for lifetime visibility (less than one night's stay)</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="bg-white">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 space-y-10">
    <div class="space-y-4 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-600 uppercase">Two tiers, one goal</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">Get discovered. Get leads. Get booked.</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Choose visibility-only or upgrade to capture hot leads before they book elsewhere. Cancel anytime.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 items-stretch">
      <%= render partial: "plan", collection: @plans, as: :plan %>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 border-t border-b border-blue-100">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16">
    <div class="text-center space-y-6 mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">Why hosts choose TripHeatMap</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">We're not another booking platform. We're your SEO and lead generation partner.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
        <div class="text-blue-600 text-4xl mb-4">🔍</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Get found on Google</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">We focus on ranking for neighborhood searches in 200+ cities. When travelers Google "best neighborhoods in Austin" or "vibrant areas Seattle", your property can be discovered before they even open Airbnb or VRBO.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
        <div class="text-blue-600 text-4xl mb-4">🤖</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Get recommended by AI</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">AI assistants like ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, and Grok can discover our guides when travelers ask "where should I stay in [city]?". Your listing gets exposure through a channel that doesn't exist through traditional booking platforms.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
        <div class="text-blue-600 text-4xl mb-4">💰</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Keep 100% of your revenue</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Airbnb takes 15-20% and VRBO takes 10-15%. We never touch your bookings. Your entire pricing strategy is a fixed monthly cost (less than one night's stay)—no commissions, ever.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
        <div class="text-blue-600 text-4xl mb-4">🎯</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Close hot leads before competitors</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600"><span class="font-semibold">Monthly/Annual plans:</span> Get notified when travelers save searches in your area. These are ready-to-book leads who've researched your neighborhood and know their budget. Reach out first with a deal and close them.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-600 to-emerald-600 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 text-white text-center">
      <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4">We only get paid if you get paid</h3>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-green-50 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-6">
        Monthly/Annual plans come with no time limit refunds. Cancel anytime. If you're not getting value, you shouldn't pay. Simple as that. We succeed when you succeed.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-green-100">Lifetime plan: 30-day money-back guarantee. No risk, no hassle.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="bg-slate-50 border-t border-b border-gray-200">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16 space-y-8">
    <div class="space-y-3 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-600 uppercase">Frequently Asked</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900">What hosts ask before listing</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      <% @faqs.each do |faq| %>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
          <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900"><%= faq[:question] %></p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600"><%= faq[:answer] %></p>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
